1
00:00:03,055 --> 00:00:04,807
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:05,349 --> 00:00:07,935
<font color="white">如果你不愿意相信我</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:08,019 --> 00:00:10,229
<font color="white">即使独自一人 我也会去做</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:10,312 --> 00:00:11,772
<font color="white">进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:13,858 --> 00:00:15,234
<font color="white">慢着！</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:15,317 --> 00:00:17,486
<font color="white">为什么要阻止我？</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:18,529 --> 00:00:19,947
<font color="white">追了也没用</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:20,531 --> 00:00:21,907
<font color="white">可恶！</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:02:12,810 --> 00:02:14,061
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:24,738 --> 00:02:26,407
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:26,490 --> 00:02:27,992
<font color="white">进次郎他…</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:28,075 --> 00:02:29,910
<font color="white">我听井手先生说了</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:29,994 --> 00:02:34,039
<font color="white">那么身为看着他逃走的当事人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你有什么看法？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:35,916 --> 00:02:39,044
<font color="white">我也需要一些时间整理思绪</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:43,549
<font color="white">我当然也很想相信进次郎所说的话</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:44,508 --> 00:02:47,469
<font color="white">可是他最近的样子</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:48,053 --> 00:02:50,097
<font color="white">让我搞不懂</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:52,683
<font color="white">诸星先生觉得呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:53,392 --> 00:02:54,977
<font color="white">不好说</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:55,060 --> 00:02:57,146
<font color="white">那小子的事情先暂且不提</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:58,188 --> 00:03:02,109
<font color="white">外星人入侵科学特搜队的目的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也很让人在意</font></font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:07,197 --> 00:03:08,198
<font color="white">太郎</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:08,282 --> 00:03:10,784
<font color="white">可以麻烦你跟诸星一起过来吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:13,913 --> 00:03:16,332
<font color="white">要我们去带回进次郎？</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:17,041 --> 00:03:19,710
<font color="white">也只能由我们亲手带他回来了</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:19,793 --> 00:03:22,755
<font color="white">总不能将他通缉</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:22,838 --> 00:03:26,926
<font color="white">我不认为进次郎现在这样子</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">会坦率接受我们的说服</font></font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:27,927 --> 00:03:30,888
<font color="white">是啊 我十分明白</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:31,472 --> 00:03:34,433
<font color="white">那你的意思是…</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:35,100 --> 00:03:36,894
<font color="white">意思是若情况所需</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:36,977 --> 00:03:39,647
<font color="white">会准许我们动用武力吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:40,231 --> 00:03:42,191
<font color="white">虽然并非我们本意</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:42,816 --> 00:03:46,153
<font color="white">但那也是不得已的</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:46,237 --> 00:03:52,868
<font color="white">现在我们面临的问题不只那一个</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:52,952 --> 00:03:55,371
<font color="white">我们必需做到的职责…</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:55,454 --> 00:03:56,288
<font color="white">（类别 梅菲斯特）</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:56,372 --> 00:03:58,749
<font color="white">就是断绝祸害的根源</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:58,832 --> 00:04:00,000
<font color="white">（行踪不明）</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:00,084 --> 00:04:01,627
<font color="white">也就是说</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:01,710 --> 00:04:05,005
<font color="white">我们要干掉四名奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:05,756 --> 00:04:10,177
<font color="white">他说的“四名奥特曼”是指…</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:10,928 --> 00:04:12,972
<font color="white">下落不明的早田</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:13,055 --> 00:04:15,724
<font color="white">还有进次郎显然包含在内</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:16,517 --> 00:04:17,893
<font color="white">不过…</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:17,977 --> 00:04:20,312
<font color="white">剩下两人到底是谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:23,607 --> 00:04:25,234
<font color="white">总而言之</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:25,317 --> 00:04:28,028
<font color="white">我要拜托你们尽快找出进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:28,112 --> 00:04:29,780
<font color="white">并且拘捕他</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:29,863 --> 00:04:33,200
<font color="white">这样做也是为了保护他的安全</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:33,284 --> 00:04:34,785
<font color="white">-知道了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-知道了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:56,890 --> 00:04:59,018
<font color="white">对喔</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:04:59,101 --> 00:05:01,020
<font color="white">原来是那么一回事</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:03,856 --> 00:05:05,774
<font color="white">好吧</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:05,858 --> 00:05:08,527
<font color="white">先冷静下来整理现况</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:13,490 --> 00:05:15,242
<font color="white">不行啦</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:05:15,326 --> 00:05:18,620
<font color="white">发生太多事情 根本没办法理清思绪</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:27,421 --> 00:05:30,174
<font color="white">我到底在做什么啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:39,433 --> 00:05:42,811
<font color="white">在我们锁定的四名奥特曼之中</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:42,895 --> 00:05:45,481
<font color="white">有两名已经成功消灭了</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:45,564 --> 00:05:48,025
<font color="white">原本正好有机会多解决一个</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:48,108 --> 00:05:50,694
<font color="white">放他一条生路真的好吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:50,778 --> 00:05:52,863
<font color="white">你别着急</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:52,946 --> 00:05:56,450
<font color="white">目前一切都按照我的剧本进行</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:57,201 --> 00:05:58,786
<font color="white">是吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:58,869 --> 00:06:04,083
<font color="white">所以若照着你的剧本</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">接着会如何发展啊？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:04,166 --> 00:06:07,836
<font color="white">你只要继续追踪奥特曼就好</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:10,172
<font color="white">不要说得那么容易</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:10,255 --> 00:06:12,049
<font color="white">而且他到底在哪里啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:12,132 --> 00:06:15,344
<font color="white">我早已做好对策了</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:17,721 --> 00:06:19,723
<font color="white">原来如此</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:19,807 --> 00:06:24,686
<font color="white">你利用外星人的联络网</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">彻底包围了奥特曼啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:25,729 --> 00:06:30,234
<font color="white">那么现在准备上演第二幕吧</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:41,495 --> 00:06:43,664
<font color="white">真的没问题吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:43,747 --> 00:06:44,832
<font color="white">你是指什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:44,915 --> 00:06:47,167
<font color="white">昨天井手先生说的那些话</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:47,251 --> 00:06:50,921
<font color="white">不就等于是容忍</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">奥特曼彼此互斗吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:51,004 --> 00:06:53,382
<font color="white">不管谁输谁赢都无法轻易收场</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:54,091 --> 00:06:57,177
<font color="white">井手先生想必是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">深知那点才下判断的吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,847
<font color="white">有异议吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:59,930 --> 00:07:01,640
<font color="white">没有</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:03,142 --> 00:07:05,269
<font color="white">只是做个最终确认而已</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:07,813 --> 00:07:09,857
<font color="white">需要加购袋子吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,191
<font color="white">不用了</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:11,275 --> 00:07:13,110
<font color="white">结账就用…</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:14,069 --> 00:07:15,696
<font color="white">我还是用现金好了</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:15,779 --> 00:07:17,781
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:23,620 --> 00:07:24,580
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈签书会）</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:24,663 --> 00:07:25,873
<font color="white">（写真散文集</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">《我的好天气》）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:30,127 --> 00:07:31,253
<font color="white">（找到匹配者 早田进次郎）</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:31,336 --> 00:07:36,049
<font color="white">脸部辨识系统寻获了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">疑似进次郎的人物</font></font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:36,133 --> 00:07:39,303
<font color="white">立刻查出详细地点 派太郎前往</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:39,386 --> 00:07:40,596
<font color="white">了解</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:43,724 --> 00:07:45,100
<font color="white">便利商店内的监视器</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:45,184 --> 00:07:47,394
<font color="white">拍摄到可能是进次郎的人物</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:47,978 --> 00:07:50,314
<font color="white">地点是淡谷町三丁目</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:07:50,397 --> 00:07:52,024
<font color="white">准备部署无人机</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:05,954 --> 00:08:10,292
<font color="white">这支手机里没有玲奈小姐的联络方式</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:09:05,055 --> 00:09:07,224
<font color="white">（检测到信号）</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:09:07,307 --> 00:09:10,394
<font color="white">进次郎手机内的全球定位系统启动了</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:09:10,978 --> 00:09:13,272
<font color="white">在这时机启动？</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:09:14,398 --> 00:09:16,108
<font color="white">不太对劲</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:09:16,608 --> 00:09:18,360
<font color="white">58号路线北方</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:09:18,443 --> 00:09:20,737
<font color="white">正以时速约50公里移动</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:09:21,863 --> 00:09:23,407
<font color="white">已经确认坐标</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:09:23,490 --> 00:09:25,701
<font color="white">绝对没有错 就是这辆车</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:09:28,662 --> 00:09:31,164
<font color="white">麻烦停一下车！</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:09:35,168 --> 00:09:36,336
<font color="white">不好意思</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:09:36,420 --> 00:09:39,339
<font color="white">可以让我检查一下车厢吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:09:39,423 --> 00:09:42,050
<font color="white">-好 请便</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-谢谢</font></font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,437
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:56,106
<font color="white">我们好像被他发现了</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:09:56,189 --> 00:09:59,234
<font color="white">知道了 你先回来吧</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:10:00,944 --> 00:10:03,947
<font color="white">没想到竟然会被那小子摆了一道</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:10:08,577 --> 00:10:09,911
<font color="white">辛苦你了</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:10:09,995 --> 00:10:11,204
<font color="white">你也辛苦了</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:10:11,288 --> 00:10:12,914
<font color="white">等等 玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:10:15,584 --> 00:10:17,919
<font color="white">明天要在书店举办签书会喔</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:10:18,003 --> 00:10:19,880
<font color="white">我10点会来接你 再麻烦你啦</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:10:19,963 --> 00:10:21,214
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:10:21,298 --> 00:10:22,591
<font color="white">没问题</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:10:22,674 --> 00:10:23,675
<font color="white">再见啦</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:10:49,284 --> 00:10:52,371
<font color="white">（通话记录 早田进次郎）</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:11:01,046 --> 00:11:02,714
<font color="white">您拨的电话无人接听</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:11:02,798 --> 00:11:07,386
<font color="white">该号码可能在收信范围外</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">或是未开启电源…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:11:39,543 --> 00:11:43,713
<font color="white">我们久违地单独聊一聊吧</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:11:43,797 --> 00:11:45,424
<font color="white">爸</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:11:46,049 --> 00:11:48,969
<font color="white">那时候到底想对我说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:52,222
<font color="white">你想做的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:11:52,305 --> 00:11:54,808
<font color="white">不就只是报仇吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:12:14,703 --> 00:12:18,081
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈签书会）</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:12:22,252 --> 00:12:24,546
<font color="white">爸爸 欢迎回家</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:12:25,255 --> 00:12:27,549
<font color="white">原来你在啊 我回来了</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:12:32,429 --> 00:12:34,389
<font color="white">我看到你上电视了</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:12:34,473 --> 00:12:35,640
<font color="white">那是怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:12:35,724 --> 00:12:38,518
<font color="white">这是什么意思？那是我的工作啊</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:12:38,602 --> 00:12:40,812
<font color="white">竟然在这种时候上那种节目</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:12:40,896 --> 00:12:42,314
<font color="white">你自己也知道会怎么样吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:12:42,397 --> 00:12:43,398
<font color="white">多替自己想一下</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:12:43,482 --> 00:12:47,819
<font color="white">所以意思是说</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你也觉得奥特曼是坏人？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:12:47,903 --> 00:12:49,654
<font color="white">我才不管这件事</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:12:49,738 --> 00:12:51,156
<font color="white">你在说谎</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:12:51,823 --> 00:12:56,745
<font color="white">其实你明明就知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">奥特曼不是坏人 对不对？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:12:57,329 --> 00:12:59,789
<font color="white">大家应该也是那么认为的</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:12:59,873 --> 00:13:03,335
<font color="white">然而他们只因为好玩</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:03,418 --> 00:13:05,921
<font color="white">就随口乱说些有的没的</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:13:06,463 --> 00:13:07,964
<font color="white">太过分了</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:13:08,048 --> 00:13:10,300
<font color="white">我不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:13:10,383 --> 00:13:12,385
<font color="white">我只能这么说</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:13:13,178 --> 00:13:17,265
<font color="white">总之你不要再牵扯进奥特曼的事情了</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:13:17,349 --> 00:13:20,227
<font color="white">竟然连你的往事都被挖出来讨论</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:13:29,361 --> 00:13:31,363
<font color="white">我说啊 爸爸</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:13:31,446 --> 00:13:32,447
<font color="white">什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:13:33,031 --> 00:13:36,868
<font color="white">你从来没有跟我说过妈妈的事情耶</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:13:37,869 --> 00:13:39,996
<font color="white">这是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:13:40,872 --> 00:13:44,668
<font color="white">爸爸 如果我问你</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">为什么要和妈妈结婚</font></font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:13:44,751 --> 00:13:46,628
<font color="white">你回答得出来吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:13:46,711 --> 00:13:48,421
<font color="white">谁会跟你说那种事啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:13:48,505 --> 00:13:49,714
<font color="white">我就说吧</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:13:49,798 --> 00:13:52,092
<font color="white">你什么都不告诉我</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:13:54,302 --> 00:13:57,013
<font color="white">归根结底 男人啊</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:13:57,639 --> 00:13:59,349
<font color="white">只要碰上越想说的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:13:59,432 --> 00:14:01,935
<font color="white">就越开不了口啦</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:14:09,192 --> 00:14:11,403
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈签书会）</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:14:11,486 --> 00:14:13,113
<font color="white">（《我的好天气》）</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:14:13,196 --> 00:14:14,739
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈）</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:14:15,574 --> 00:14:17,158
<font color="white">今后也请你继续加油</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:14:17,242 --> 00:14:19,119
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:14:21,496 --> 00:14:23,582
<font color="white">下一位 请上前</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:14:31,798 --> 00:14:34,593
<font color="white">那个 对不起</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:14:34,676 --> 00:14:36,177
<font color="white">你别走！</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:14:41,099 --> 00:14:43,393
<font color="white">归根结底 男人啊</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:14:43,476 --> 00:14:44,978
<font color="white">只要碰上越想说的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:14:45,061 --> 00:14:46,980
<font color="white">就越开不了口啦</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:14:56,031 --> 00:14:57,240
<font color="white">这本给你</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:15:02,370 --> 00:15:05,123
<font color="white">（要一直保持这样的你喔）</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:15:05,707 --> 00:15:07,083
<font color="white">要一直…</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:15:07,167 --> 00:15:10,128
<font color="white">保持这样的你喔</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:12,213
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:15:14,007 --> 00:15:16,635
<font color="white">我以后也会为你加油的</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:15:18,845 --> 00:15:20,889
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:15:32,692 --> 00:15:34,653
<font color="white">还没找到人吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:15:34,736 --> 00:15:36,321
<font color="white">不要那样催我嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:15:36,404 --> 00:15:38,740
<font color="white">科学特搜队虽然比想象中还棘手</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:15:38,823 --> 00:15:41,451
<font color="white">不过我决定反过来利用他们</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:15:42,577 --> 00:15:43,745
<font color="white">所以啊</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:15:44,371 --> 00:15:47,123
<font color="white">这次我可以打倒他们没关系吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:15:48,249 --> 00:15:51,086
<font color="white">就交给你决定吧</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:15:56,883 --> 00:15:59,052
<font color="white">您好 这里是早田家</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:16:01,054 --> 00:16:02,681
<font color="white">喂？</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:16:09,604 --> 00:16:11,231
<font color="white">是进次郎吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:16:14,359 --> 00:16:15,485
<font color="white">对</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:16:17,028 --> 00:16:18,947
<font color="white">你平安无事啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:16:21,366 --> 00:16:22,367
<font color="white">对</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:16:23,326 --> 00:16:25,161
<font color="white">有爸的消息吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:16:26,788 --> 00:16:32,210
<font color="white">听说还无法确定他的安危</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:16:35,839 --> 00:16:36,965
<font color="white">妈</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:16:37,590 --> 00:16:39,467
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:16:42,804 --> 00:16:44,264
<font color="white">如果我…</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:16:47,225 --> 00:16:50,729
<font color="white">我可能有一阵子不能回家了</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:16:53,606 --> 00:16:55,442
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:16:55,984 --> 00:16:58,278
<font color="white">难道你都不担心吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:16:58,361 --> 00:17:00,697
<font color="white">我当然会担心啊</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:17:00,780 --> 00:17:04,617
<font color="white">不过我相信你一定没问题</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:17:05,660 --> 00:17:07,787
<font color="white">我总有那种预感</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:17:10,415 --> 00:17:12,208
<font color="white">对了 进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:17:12,292 --> 00:17:15,754
<font color="white">以前你爸吩咐过我</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">万一他出了什么事</font></font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:17:15,837 --> 00:17:19,215
<font color="white">就要我去一个地方</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:17:20,216 --> 00:17:22,677
<font color="white">等等 我准备纸条记下来</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:17:38,568 --> 00:17:41,488
<font color="white">是这里没错吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:18:08,556 --> 00:18:09,766
<font color="white">真有一套啊</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:18:09,849 --> 00:18:12,185
<font color="white">不愧是继承者呢</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:18:12,268 --> 00:18:14,062
<font color="white">你是谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:18:14,145 --> 00:18:15,855
<font color="white">你们难道有规定</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:18:15,939 --> 00:18:19,025
<font color="white">不先自我介绍 要直接向对方发问？</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:19:02,068 --> 00:19:03,862
<font color="white">痛死了…</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:19:05,488 --> 00:19:08,533
<font color="white">竟然敢徒手接下我的攻击</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:19:09,075 --> 00:19:11,995
<font color="white">你还挺有胆量的嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:19:12,078 --> 00:19:17,208
<font color="white">你那种有勇无谋的个性 我不讨厌哦</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:19:52,452 --> 00:19:54,787
<font color="white">如果我有装甲的话…</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:20:15,016 --> 00:20:16,726
<font color="white">真是的</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:20:16,809 --> 00:20:19,395
<font color="white">太郎先生 为什么你在这里？</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:20:19,479 --> 00:20:22,899
<font color="white">进次郎 不要再逃下去了</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:20:22,982 --> 00:20:26,402
<font color="white">那样的话我们也可以保护你</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:20:26,486 --> 00:20:29,030
<font color="white">实在是太麻烦了</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:20:29,113 --> 00:20:32,033
<font color="white">我就一次对付你们两个吧</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:20:47,173 --> 00:20:49,842
<font color="white">别跑啊 进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:20:57,141 --> 00:20:58,518
<font color="white">要是你敢东张西望</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:20:58,601 --> 00:20:59,894
<font color="white">我就先解决你</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:20:59,978 --> 00:21:02,647
<font color="white">上次我被你打得落花流水</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:21:02,730 --> 00:21:05,108
<font color="white">这次可不会让你得逞</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:21:07,193 --> 00:21:08,820
<font color="white">我们走着瞧</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:21:16,619 --> 00:21:18,538
<font color="white">到此为止了</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:21:19,038 --> 00:21:20,915
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:21:21,541 --> 00:21:23,835
<font color="white">跟你对打太费劲了</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:21:24,836 --> 00:21:26,546
<font color="white">乖乖就范吧</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:21:59,787 --> 00:22:02,165
<font color="white">很好 看来没有追兵</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:22:03,124 --> 00:22:05,585
<font color="white">我还没老到会输给这群年轻人呢</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:22:05,668 --> 00:22:09,547
<font color="white">不过有特地去跟年轻人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">较劲的心态就代表已经够老了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:22:11,132 --> 00:22:13,051
<font color="white">请问你是谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:22:13,134 --> 00:22:14,802
<font color="white">你该不会是…</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:22:16,471 --> 00:22:18,848
<font color="white">我叫岚大助</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:22:18,931 --> 00:22:22,018
<font color="white">是科学特搜队的前队员</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:09,167
<font color="white">字幕翻译：蒋文昊</font><font color="white"></font>

